From 846551e0cbc56b3ae0f4474a708414b84b7024d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:00:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Elastic prediction solved with the elastic operator of the
 fixed point solver

AbstractNonLinearSolver::getElasticPredictionLinearSolver lets a non linear
solver provide the linear solver of the elastic predictions of the problem
(null by default: the linear solver of the problem is used).
FixedPointSolver provides, with the option PredictionLinearSolver set to
ElasticOperator, the conjugate gradient of MFEM preconditioned by the
linear solver of the elastic operator, whose setup is kept (for instance
one cycle of BoomerAMG), instead of a new setup of the preconditioner of
the problem at each time step.
